        1417,
        1335
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 2. Audit Committee Continued. The Audit\nCommittee of the City of New York (the \"Committee\") is\nhereby continued and shall consist of the Mayor, the\nComptroller, the President of the City Council, each of whom\nshall serve ex officio (the \"City Members\") and four other\npersons (the \"Private Members\") as provided in Section 3.\nThe members of the Committee shall elect a Private Member as\nChairperson of the Committee for an annual term commencing\non March 1 of each year.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2341,
